  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to boil.\n• Cook spaghetti in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 9 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/2 cup for 2P / 1 cup for 4P), then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b7355cd378378da7aae2fe/step-cd602d00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop kalamata olives. Finely chop garlic.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b7355cd378378da7aae2fe/step-fb235b10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over high heat.\n• Cook soffritto mix, stirring occasionally, until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Stir in garlic & herb spice blend, tomato & herb seasoning, olives and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Reduce to medium heat. Add lentils, passata, the reserved pasta water, butter and brown sugar and cook until thickened, 1-2 mins.\n• Add cooked spaghetti and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b7355cd378378da7aae2fe/step-ccbf8f20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide lentil spag bol between bowls.\n• Top with Parmesan cheese to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b7355cd378378da7aae2fe/step-0a112b30.jpg"
    }
  ]
